    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naabonekera Solomooni obwakabiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomooni obu yamazire kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA n'ey'omukama, n'amaju agandi aga yagondeze kwombeka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yamubonekera obwakabiri nkooku yamubonekiire omu rubuga Gibbyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamugambira ati: “Mpuliire okusaba n'okwesengereza kwawe; enju enu ei wayombekere, ebe kiikaro eki ndaaramizibwamuga ebiro byona, ngyeereze. Akasumi koona, amaiso gange n'omutima gwange, ndaabiikazaaga ha kiikaro eki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi obu olikora ebi ngonza nka Sso Daudi oku yakozire, oina omutima omurungi kandi oguterekeriire, okahikiriza byona ebi nakuragiire, okakwata ebiragiro byange n'ebigambo byange, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 2:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndihikiriza okunihiza okunakozire na sso Daudi obunamugambire ngu Isirairi eralemwaga abaijukuru be ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu iwe rundi abaijukuru bawe obu balireka kumpondera, obu olireka kuhondera amateeka n'ebiragiro byange ebinakuhaire, okaramya abaruhanga bandi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu abantu bange Isirairi ndibaiha omunsi eyinabahaire eyinyereze nk'ekiikaro ekindaramizibwamuga ndigirugamu. Hoona hoona abantu balisekereza Isirairi kandi bagirole nk'ekintu ekitagasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakam 25:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 36:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enju enu erifooka ntuumo y'ekifurukwa kandi buli omu aragirabahoga aracwekwaaga enkizi ahunirre. Balyekaguza bati: ‘MUKAMA akagenderraki ensi n'enju enu kubikora ati?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baligarukamu ngu, ‘Habwokuba bakaruga hali MUKAMA Ruhanga wabo ayaihire baisenkurubo munsi Misiri. Bakeemaliza habaaruhanga abandi; baabaramya, nikyo MUKAMA abanagire akabi kanu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyaka amakumi abiri, Solomooni ei yayombekiiremu amaju abiri: enju ya MUKAMA n'ey'omukama obu yahoireho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu omukama wa Taya akaba ahaire Solomooni embaaho ez'emiti emikogoto n'emisambya, na zaabbu yoona ei yagondeze, Solomooni na uwe nukwo kuha Hiramu embuga amakumi abiri ez'omu nsi ya Galilaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Hiramu obu yarugire Taya yagenda kurora embuga Solomooni ezi akaba amuhaire, ataisiime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yayekaguza ati: “Mwana wa mau, zinu, ompaire embuga za mulingo ki?” Embuga ezi, nikyo zaayetiirwe ensi eya Kabula, n'okuhika hati, nukwo kugamba: “Katali mugaso”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu akaba atwekiire Solomooni kiloguraamu bikumi bbina eza zaabbu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki, nikyo kyayoheriize omukama Solomooni okuragira abantu n'obusobozi, bombeke enju ya MUKAMA, n'eye nyabwe, Miilo, n'ekisiika ekya Yerusaalemu, Hazooli, Megido, na Gezeri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(omukama Faraaho, akaba aseesire orubuga Gezeri, arwokeze n'omurro, aisire Abanyakanaani abaikaraga omu rubuga oru; kandi arusagaliire muhara we, muka Solomooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Solomooni, yayombeka buhyaaka orubuga Gezeri) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Besi-horoni eya ifo, Balaagi, na Tamara omwirungu, omu nsi eya Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'embuga zoona ez'okwahurwamu Solomooni ezi akaba aina, n'embuga ez'okutamu ebigaali bye, embuga ezaaraarwamuga abatembi be ab'embaraasi, kyona Solomooni eki yakagondeze kwombeka omu rubuga Yerusaalemu, Lebanoni, n'omunsi yoona ei yalemaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boona abaasaagireho ha: Bamooli, Abahiiti, Abapereezi, Abahiivi n'Abayebusi abakaba batali bantu ba Isirairi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abakaba baina abaijukuru abasigaire omunsi, Abaisirairi aba batarasoboire kuhwerekerereza kimu abo boona, Solomooni akabafoora bairu ab'okukora emirimo, na hati hoona, bakyali bairu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Abaisirairi, Solomooni atabafoole bairu; bbo bakaba bali baserikale, abandi banyoro be, abandi ngabwa z'amahe ge, abandi beebembezi be, abandi ngabwa z'ebigaali bye, kandi n'abasaija be abatembi b'embaraasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo nubo bakaba bali banyoro abakuru abaarolerraga omulimo gwa Solomooni; bakahika bbikumi bbitaano mu ataano, nubo baarolerraga abantu abaakoraga omulimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu, muhara wa Faraaho, akaruga omu rubuga rwa Daudi, yataaha enju ye nyabwe, Solomooni ei yamwombekiire; hanyuma Solomooni, yayombeka Miilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
